e or not to construct an interesting graph. If the answer is ┬½ YES ┬╗, in the second line output k ΓÇö the amount of edges that should be added to the initial graph. Finally, output k lines: pairs of vertices x j and y j , between which edges should be drawn. The result may contain multiple edges and loops. k can be equal to zero.\n\n## Examples\n\nExample 1:\n```\n3 2\n1 2\n2 3\n```\n```\nYES\n1\n1 3\n```","type":"text"}],"contestId":9,"index":"E","memoryLimit":"64 megabytes","name":"Interestring graph and Apples","problemKey":"9-E","rating":null,"tags":[],"timeLimit":"1 second","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/9/problem/E"}],"schemaVersion":1}
